 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 516172,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "If the probability of an event <span data-math=\"E\">E</span> is 80%, find the odds for and the odds against <span data-math=\"E\">E</span>.\n",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Odds for:</p>\n<p>If the probability is 80%, then the odds for the event are <span data-math=\"0.8:\\left( {1 - 0.8} \\right)\"></span>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"0.8{\\text{ }}:{\\text{ }}0.2\"></span></p>\n<p>You can simplify the ratio by dividing both numbers by 0.8.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"1{\\text{ }}:{\\text{ }}0.25\"></span></p>\n<p>You can multiply again by 4 to get rid of decimals.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"4{\\text{ }}:{\\text{ }}1\"></span></p>\n<p>Odds against: (reverse the numbers).</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"1{\\text{ }}:{\\text{ }}4\"></span></p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "The odds for <span data-math=\"E\">E</span> are <span data-math=\"4{:}1\">4{:}1</span> and the odds against <span data-math=\"E\">E</span> are <span data-math=\"1{:}4\">1{:}4</span>."
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
